OL,3,ARecord heatwaves in France set to make
OL,4,Achampagne stronger
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance's Champagne region also saw its
OL,7,Fearliest-ever harvest due to the
OL,8,Fweather, something that could become
OL,9,Fthe norm "in 10 to 15 years" because of
OL,10,Fclimate change, according to the Comite
OL,11,FChampagne industry association.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
